# Resolved by `op run` when tools/directories.py asks Spotify for each
# episode's own link. Committed on purpose: every op:// below is a
# REFERENCE, not a value.
#
#   op run --env-file=tools/spotify.env -- ./tools/directories.py
#
# The app is made at developer.spotify.com/dashboard, any name, no redirect
# URI used: the client credentials flow reads the public catalogue and
# nothing of any user. Since March 2026 the account that owns the app must
# hold Premium, or the app stops answering. One API Credential item.
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=op://Engineering/Spotify podcast app/username
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_SECRET=op://Engineering/Spotify podcast app/credential
